# Air Temperature Time Series Forecasting

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analysing air temperature data and forecasting future temperatures using time series analysis.

## Objective
To study historical air temperature patterns and predict future temperatures.

## Dataset
The dataset contains air temperature observations used for time series forecasting.

## Project File
- `AirTemperatureTime_series_forecasting.ipynb` — Jupyter Notebook containing the project code and analysis.

## Tools and Technologies
- Python
- Jupyter Notebook
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn

## Project Workflow
1. Load the dataset.
2. Explore and analyse the temperature data.
3. Preprocess the data.
4. Apply time series forecasting techniques.
5. Evaluate the forecasting results.

## Conclusion
This project explores time series forecasting techniques to understand temperature patterns and predict future air temperatures.
